oads/origins/55a48b55-960f-4abe-a534-02a983781451?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6bafa54343abc5307cd688e062e675bf 2x, https://si.imgix.net/6e708154/uploads/origins/55a48b55-960f-4abe-a534-02a983781451?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=16c8b54640b59df7a47788cba87060dd 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! I find your work quite lovely. I was wondering if you would please draw my OC (man with frog) and this dear succubus together in some kind of cute pose. His arm would be around her shoulder and they would be in some type of outdoor city setting.\n\nFacial expressions and general poses can be up to you! Thank you\n\nReferences for both of them are here\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/NmhjTs6", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@mituki____841/works/72", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/6c374e22/uploads/origins/a819a222-a861-4f13-91b5-2f6b1d091634?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3281a0db7f0fcd9aa37609078495a1b8", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6c374e22/uploads/origins/a819a222-a861-4f13-91b5-2f6b1d091634?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3281a0db7f0fcd9aa37609078495a1b8, https://si.imgix.net/6c374e22/uploads/origins/a819a222-a861-4f13-91b5-2f6b1d091634?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0b4f64bcedd8d044ed501e156a3feb59 2x, https://si.imgix.net/6c374e22/uploads/origins/a819a222-a861-4f13-91b5-2f6b1d091634?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=eb9ff5f58dc02d8005c0975e76c66dbe 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "はじめまして！！\n創作活動で他デザイナー様に作成してもらったオリキャラの\nイメージを広げるため二次創作を御願いしたいです。\n\n未来世界で活躍する人間同等（というか人間以上）のアンドロイドＡＩです。\n基本的にクールな性格の設定ですが感情は豊かです。\n衣装はそのまま系でも別衣装でも良いです。\n\n使用範囲は\n自前の紹介サイトや、ＳＮＳでの掲載となります。\n※トリミング使用も予定しています。\n\n御面倒かけますが\nよろしく御検討ください！\n\nhttps://twitter.com/oniyatsuhash